# The hermes crontab as it ran on 2026-10-03 (28 job lines, then the guardian's own at install: 29), read with crontab -l.
# The guardian compares the live crontab with these lines by the command each one runs
# (vps-crontab). A line missing from the live crontab is reported; extra live lines are fine.
# When a line is changed or removed on purpose, change it here in the same commit.
# The guardian's own lines are added at install (README.md). No secrets: every line sources env files.

